     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Meals",
     "texto": [
      "**Obiad** is the main meal of the day; **kolacja** is the evening meal.",
      "There is no article like «the» in front of these nouns."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The direct object",
     "texto": [
      "With **lubię** and **jem**, many feminine foods end in **-ę**: **zupa → zupę**, **ryba → rybę**.",
      "After a negation, the object usually takes the genitive: **Nie lubię mięsa** («I don't like meat»)."
     ],
